# ─── Vanta credential ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# There is NO environment variable for Vanta credentials, and no env fallback
# anywhere in this service (SOP §3.1). Every tool call must carry its own
# tenant's OAuth2 client id/secret pair in two HTTP headers instead — see
# README.md § Authentication headers. This is intentional: a shared env
# credential would break per-tenant isolation in a multi-tenant deployment.

# ─── MCP HTTP server ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
MCP_HTTP_HOST=0.0.0.0
MCP_HTTP_PORT=8080
